{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an alternate-history 2005, the forgotten \u201980s platformer <strong>COCOBOY</strong> has re-entered the spotlight, sparking the rise of a  niche community of passionate fans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864040/extras/fed1ec50b01a338d922907db3e3bad42.webp?t=1755109485\" alt=\"Demo Disc Information\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COCOBOY Demo Disc</strong> is a culmination of around the first year of COCOBOY's development. The contents of this demo include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorial area and the first level, Coco Coast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Modcart abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 collectible merchandise items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full support for Keyboard &amp; Mouse, Controller, and Steam Deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All major planned game systems and quality of life including shop, forum, room decoration, save data, and settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bonus level  from the game jam version, now known as the Gray Wastes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This level isn't up to final release standards, but we left it in to give more content to play with.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864040/extras/1b91d7dbce4570f9e5620306e0e12b0c.webp?t=1755109485\" alt=\"MODIFY, BRUTE FORCE, &amp;amp; RESTORE an 80&#039;s cult classic.\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864040/extras/2a964745ce32ddf586bfe60d1420020d.poster.avif?t=1755109485\" width=810 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864040/extras/2a964745ce32ddf586bfe60d1420020d.webm?t=1755109485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864040/extras/2a964745ce32ddf586bfe60d1420020d.mp4?t=1755109485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience COCOBOY like never before with <strong>Modcarts</strong>\u2014cartridge-like devices hacked together by tech-savvy community members. Discover clever combinations of mods to progress, uncover tricky secrets, and even break level design in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864040/extras/88d40606fbdce44c5b23d49f539d4b45.webp?t=1755109485\" alt=\"COLLECT and DECORATE with rare merchandise.\" width=600 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864040/extras/c5b5937d54584470b052ed11c1b040f4.poster.avif?t=1755109485\" width=810 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864040/extras/c5b5937d54584470b052ed11c1b040f4.webm?t=1755109485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864040/extras/c5b5937d54584470b052ed11c1b040f4.mp4?t=1755109485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need a break from the platforming action? Take a breather and decorate your  bedroom with rare pieces of COCOBOY memorabilia. Discover merchandise from a game franchise thought to be lost to time... and buy them with coins you find throughout its levels! Who knows... maybe these artifacts can even guide you to secrets in the game itself..?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864040/extras/ced24054c5a1e3b40f3611854cd8e45c.webp?t=1755109485\" alt=\"IMMERSE in a new and peculiar fandom.\" width=600 height=61 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Browse the online COCOBOY Forums and experience a community growing in real-time as you play. Check discussion threads for game tips, hints, rumors, theories, and arguments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864040/extras/90b64a8190331f4986554d11b54212f4.webp?t=1755109485\" alt=\"Development\" width=600 height=61 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A prototype  version was originally developed in one week for Vinesauce's Shroomjam 2024. After seeing how much the original game resonated, we decided to continue development and make COCOBOY a full game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3864040?t=1755109485","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864040/17a4ffdbc8baef71d65505ab7baf694edddc4b3b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755109485","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864040/c3c3b7fca35495b2eb5cb8b2184a2f0f461f922e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755109485","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864040/c3c3b7fca35495b2eb5cb8b2184a2f0f461f922e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755109485","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an alternate-history 2005, the forgotten \u201980s platformer <strong>COCOBOY</strong> has re-entered the spotlight, sparking the rise of a  niche community of passionate fans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864040/extras/fed1ec50b01a338d922907db3e3bad42.webp?t=1755109485\" alt=\"Demo Disc Information\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COCOBOY Demo Disc</strong> is a culmination of around the first year of COCOBOY's development. The contents of this demo include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorial area and the first level, Coco Coast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Modcart abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 collectible merchandise items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full support for Keyboard &amp; Mouse, Controller, and Steam Deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All major planned game systems and quality of life including shop, forum, room decoration, save data, and settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bonus level  from the game jam version, now known as the Gray Wastes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This level isn't up to final release standards, but we left it in to give more content to play with.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864040/extras/1b91d7dbce4570f9e5620306e0e12b0c.webp?t=1755109485\" alt=\"MODIFY, BRUTE FORCE, &amp;amp; RESTORE an 80&#039;s cult classic.\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864040/extras/2a964745ce32ddf586bfe60d1420020d.poster.avif?t=1755109485\" width=810 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864040/extras/2a964745ce32ddf586bfe60d1420020d.webm?t=1755109485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864040/extras/2a964745ce32ddf586bfe60d1420020d.mp4?t=1755109485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience COCOBOY like never before with <strong>Modcarts</strong>\u2014cartridge-like devices hacked together by tech-savvy community members. Discover clever combinations of mods to progress, uncover tricky secrets, and even break level design in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864040/extras/88d40606fbdce44c5b23d49f539d4b45.webp?t=1755109485\" alt=\"COLLECT and DECORATE with rare merchandise.\" width=600 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864040/extras/c5b5937d54584470b052ed11c1b040f4.poster.avif?t=1755109485\" width=810 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864040/extras/c5b5937d54584470b052ed11c1b040f4.webm?t=1755109485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864040/extras/c5b5937d54584470b052ed11c1b040f4.mp4?t=1755109485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need a break from the platforming action? Take a breather and decorate your  bedroom with rare pieces of COCOBOY memorabilia. Discover merchandise from a game franchise thought to be lost to time... and buy them with coins you find throughout its levels! Who knows... maybe these artifacts can even guide you to secrets in the game itself..?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864040/extras/ced24054c5a1e3b40f3611854cd8e45c.webp?t=1755109485\" alt=\"IMMERSE in a new and peculiar fandom.\" width=600 height=61 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Browse the online COCOBOY Forums and experience a community growing in real-time as you play. Check discussion threads for game tips, hints, rumors, theories, and arguments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864040/extras/90b64a8190331f4986554d11b54212f4.webp?t=1755109485\" alt=\"Development\" width=600 height=61 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A prototype  version was originally developed in one week for Vinesauce's Shroomjam 2024. After seeing how much the original game resonated, we decided to continue development and make COCOBOY a full game.</p>","developers":["Adrian Kellman","Cameron Werner"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3589190","name":"COCOBOY"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864040/dce76684e215275fb999bbaa035ec61efb5924dd/header.jpg?t=1755109485","is